sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Sam (Maple & Main staff)
  participant B as Browser
  participant C as Connector (control room server)
  participant K as Keycloak (maple-and-main realm)
  S->>B: Open the control room
  B->>C: GET /api/state
  C-->>B: 401 login_required
  B-->>S: "Sign in with Maple & Main"
  S->>B: Click
  B->>C: GET /auth/login
  Note over C: Make state, nonce and a PKCE verifier.<br/>Keep them server-side.
  C-->>B: Redirect to Keycloak with code_challenge
  B->>K: Login page
  S->>K: Username and password
  K-->>B: Redirect to /auth/callback?code=...&state=...
  B->>C: GET /auth/callback
  C->>K: Swap code + verifier + client secret for tokens
  K-->>C: ID token
  Note over C: Check the ID token's signature,<br/>issuer, audience and nonce
  C-->>B: Set an HttpOnly session cookie, redirect to /
  Note over B: The browser never holds a token
